            <note corresp="#d187-f3" n="3" xml:id="d187-f3-content">
                <p>The President was asked questions on Vietnam at his October 9 press conference,
                    but not specifically about the 2-year projected time span for American
                    disengagement from Vietnam. For the transcript of the conference, see Public
                    Papers of the Presidents of the United States: John
                        F. Kennedy, 1963, pp. 767-774.</p>
            </note>
